>I'm trying to install NetHack on an Olivetti PC. My first attempt ended in
>failure. Apparently the graphics are not compatible with IBM. Does anyone
>have any experience installing NH on this machine and/or suggestions on
>the proper configuration?


Unless you do not have 640K and a hard drive, nethack is very easily
installable, however you MUST have the ANSI.SYS (or nansy.sys) file,
and this file must be in the config.sys as:

device = ansi.sys  

ofcourse don't forget the appropriate paths.

ps. it was assumed you ftp'd the nethack correctly (i.e. in binary mode,
    for if you did not do so, the nethack will be screwed too).

